WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.863 --> 00:00:03.431
GREATEST MOMENTS HERE AT PEBBLE

00:00:03.432 --> 00:00:03.765
BEACH.

00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:05.800
FIRST UP, THOUGH, PRESIDENT

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.669
TRUMP SAYING HE KNOWS IRAN IS

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.370
RESPONSIBLE FOR A RECENT SERIES

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:11.206
OF TANKER ATTACKS AND HIS

00:00:11.207 --> 00:00:12.974
DEFENSE DEPARTMENT PROVIDING

00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:16.044
WHAT IT SAYS IS VIDEO EVIDENCE.

00:00:16.045 --> 00:00:17.612
CORRESPONDENT, KEVIN CORKE, IS

00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:18.813
AT THE WHITE HOUSE TO SHOW US

00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:19.280
TONIGHT.

00:00:19.281 --> 00:00:22.650
GOOD EVENING, KEVIN.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:26.020
&gt;&gt; EVENING, BRET.

00:00:26.021 --> 00:00:29.424
WHAT IT PURPORTS TO SHOW, IF

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:32.460
IT'S ACCURATE, THE IRANIANS ARE

00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:36.264
BEHIND A SERIES OF ATTACKS IN

00:00:36.265 --> 00:00:38.166
THE REGION.

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:39.033
THAT'S WHAT THE PRESIDENT

00:00:39.034 --> 00:00:39.400
BELIEVES.

00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:43.137
&gt;&gt; HAPPY BIRTHDAY TO YOU.

00:00:43.138 --> 00:00:45.073
&gt;&gt; Reporter: A HAPPY 73rd

00:00:45.074 --> 00:00:46.407
BIRTHDAY SERENADE FOR PRESIDENT

00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:48.309
TRUMP IN THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.678
WHILE HIS ATTENTION IN THE ROSE

00:00:50.679 --> 00:00:57.552
GARDEN WAS ON DOMESTIC POLICY,

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:02.156
EARLIER, HE TOOK -- ABOUT IRAN'S

00:01:02.157 --> 00:01:02.524
BEHAVIOR.

00:01:02.525 --> 00:01:04.125
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE MINES DIDN'T

00:01:04.126 --> 00:01:06.294
EXPLODE AND IT HAS IRAN WRITTEN

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:06.794
ALL OVER IT.

00:01:06.795 --> 00:01:09.631
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WHAT IRAN DID, THE

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:13.635
PRESIDENT SURMISED, WAS ATTACK

00:01:13.636 --> 00:01:15.069
OIL TANKERS THIS WEEK.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:18.072
FOOTAGE SHOWING THEM ATTEMPTING

00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:23.278
TO REMOVE UNEXPLODED EVIDENCE

00:01:23.279 --> 00:01:24.979
FROM A TANKER.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.047
&gt;&gt; THEY DIDN'T WANT THE EVIDENCE

00:01:26.048 --> 00:01:26.881
LEFT BEHIND.

00:01:26.882 --> 00:01:28.182
THEY DON'T KNOW WE HAVE THINGS

00:01:28.183 --> 00:01:31.252
THAT WE CAN DETECT IN THE DARK

00:01:31.253 --> 00:01:32.086
THAT WORK WELL.

00:01:32.087 --> 00:01:33.021
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE FOREIGN

00:01:33.022 --> 00:01:34.556
MINISTER SAID THIS WAS PROOF

00:01:34.557 --> 00:01:36.925
THAT THE U.S. HAS SABOTAGED

00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:37.292
DIPLOMACY.

00:01:37.293 --> 00:01:38.693
THIS INCIDENT COMES A MONTH

00:01:38.694 --> 00:01:40.061
AFTER FOUR OIL TANKERS WERE

00:01:40.062 --> 00:01:46.868
DAMAGED IN ATTACKS THAT THE FRUM

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:47.569
ADMI

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:48.369
-- TRUMP ADMINISTRATION BLAMED

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.270
ON IRAN.

00:01:49.271 --> 00:01:50.872
&gt;&gt; WE HAD 14 DIFFERENT SITES OF

00:01:50.873 --> 00:01:51.239
CONFLICT.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.240
THEY WERE IN CHARGE OF EVERY

00:01:52.241 --> 00:01:52.707
SINGLE PLACE.

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.142
THEY REALLY ARE.

00:01:54.143 --> 00:01:55.510
THEY ARE A NATION OF TERROR.

00:01:55.511 --> 00:01:58.980
THEY HAVE CHANGED A LOT SINCE I

00:01:58.981 --> 00:01:59.581
HAVE BEEN PRESIDENT.

00:01:59.582 --> 00:02:00.915
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WHILE SOME HAVE

00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:02.617
SUGGESTED CONTINUED IRANIAN

00:02:02.618 --> 00:02:04.452
AGGRESSION COULD HASTEN THE

00:02:04.453 --> 00:02:05.687
DRUMBEAT TOWARD WAR, PRESIDENT

00:02:05.688 --> 00:02:07.589
TRUMP TOLD FOX NEWS THAT THANKS

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.123
TO HIS OUTREACH TOWARDS KIM

00:02:09.124 --> 00:02:10.458
JONG-UN, THE U.S. AVERTED A WAR

00:02:10.459 --> 00:02:11.659
WITH NORTH KOREA.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:12.560
&gt;&gt; THE PAPERS COULDN'T BELIEVE

00:02:12.561 --> 00:02:15.597
WHEN WE HAD THE FIRST MEETING.

00:02:15.598 --> 00:02:16.598
THEY COULDN'T BELIEVE WHEN WE

00:02:16.599 --> 00:02:17.799
HAD THE SECOND.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.200
WE NEVER HAD MEETINGS.

00:02:19.201 --> 00:02:20.835
IF I WASN'T PRESIDENT, YOU WOULD

00:02:20.836 --> 00:02:22.804
RIGHT NOW BE IN A MAJOR WAR WITH

00:02:22.805 --> 00:02:23.738
NORTH KOREA.

00:02:23.739 --> 00:02:26.040
&gt;&gt; Reporter: STILL, A WAR OF

00:02:26.041 --> 00:02:28.610
ANOTHER KIND, A TRADE WORE WITH

00:02:28.611 --> 00:02:29.877
CHINA, THEY CONTINUE TO WORRY

00:02:29.878 --> 00:02:31.379
INVESTIGATORS ACROSS THE GLOBE.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.781
WITH THE G-20 MEETINGS SET FOR

00:02:33.782 --> 00:02:35.149
LATER THIS MONTH, THE PRESIDENT

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.084
SHOWED LITTLE INTEREST IN

00:02:36.085 --> 00:02:37.285
CHANGING COURSE TO MAKE A DEAL

00:02:37.286 --> 00:02:37.919
WITH BEIJING.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:38.886
&gt;&gt; IT DOESN'T MATTER.

00:02:38.887 --> 00:02:40.221
IF HE SHOWS UP, GOOD.

00:02:40.222 --> 00:02:41.489
IF HE DOESN'T, IN THE MEANTIME

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:45.660
WE ARE TAKING IN BILLIONS OF

00:02:45.661 --> 00:02:47.895
DOLLARS A MONTH FROM CHINA.

00:02:47.896 --> 00:02:49.230
EVENTUALLY, THEY ARE GOING TO

00:02:49.231 --> 00:02:49.998
MAKE A DEAL.

00:02:49.999 --> 00:02:50.765
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE PRESIDENT SAID

00:02:50.766 --> 00:02:52.667
THERE IS NO WAY HE IS GOING TO

00:02:52.668 --> 00:02:54.235
FIRE KELLYANNE CONWAY, COUNSELOR

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:57.372
TO THE PRESIDENT, DESPITE A

00:02:57.373 --> 00:02:59.875
RECOMMENDATION FROM A GOVERNMENT

